It has been modified by vekilberke since 2026-11-07. The changes include
Claude Code session status, permission answers and a usage meter in the
notch; clipboard history; a redesigned shelf; a dock system area; notch
notifications and downloads; a microphone and camera indicator and a
meeting-mode hotkey; a reactive pixel cat; a first-start screen; its own
application identity, installer and update channel; and the removal of the
phone link from the shared build. The full list of changes is the source
history of https://github.com/vekilberke/better-nectar compared with the
upstream commit above.

Nectar began as a fork of Bloom by Sehajveer Singh
(https://github.com/SehajveerSingh2005/bloom).

